"support."
msgstr ""
"Ciste tchuze ci doet esse eployeye cwand l' rexhowe odio n' sait nén adiercî "
"l' sopoirt S/PDIF."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:189
msgid "Force detection of Dolby Surround"
msgstr "Foirci l' deteccion di Dolby Surround"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:191
msgid ""
"Use this when you know your stream is (or is not) encoded with Dolby "
"Surround but fails to be detected as such. Even if the stream is not "
"actually encoded with Dolby Surround, turning on this option might enhance "
"your experience, especially when combined with the Headphone Channel Mixer."
msgstr ""
"Eployîz çoula cwand vos savoz ki vosse floû est (ou n' est nén) ecôdé avou "
"Dolby Surround, mins k' i n' est nén trové come tel. Minme si l' floû n' est "
"nén ecôdé avou Dolby Surround, mete en alaedje ciste tchuze ci pout amidrer "
"l' acoutaedje, copurade avou l' maxheu d' canås po les ôres-tchapeas."

